"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27T03:01:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:00Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot v4.7.dev3 \nEver since multiple bottom docks were added and this became possible https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116312\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9579) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10750H CPU @ 2.60GHz (12 threads) - 15.82 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nRemoving all bottom panel docks from the primary bottom dock causes issues.\n\nIf it was closed when the last dock was moved out of it, the version number and icons show on top of the main screen:\n\n<img width=\"1568\" height=\"151\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9fe5cc42-3e63-4f90-af30-eb6ded29805f\" />\n\n<img width=\"317\" height=\"94\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f7b11b3d-be9e-4e3c-8dcc-e9effe1b63ca\" />\n\nIf it was open when the last dock was moved out of it, the version number and icons do not show:\n\n<img width=\"1755\" height=\"174\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee66a832-1e35-429f-b0f2-050372977af7\" />\n\nThese should be shown at all times, since you need to be able to unmute toast notifications somehow and the version should be visible. The bottom panel pin and separator don't need to be shown when there are no docks here.\nTo fix it, there should be some minimum size to show it at all times.\n\nThough IMO, it is kind of weird to not have them at the bottom at all times, but we would need someplace better to put them than the primary bottom dock.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nClose or float or move all docks out of the primary bottom dock.\nThe debugger will have to move to one of the additional bottom docks since it can't float/close yet.\n\n<img width=\"366\" height=\"302\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/551ccf57-d178-4596-b2d4-e17d4a89695f\" />\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117888/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117888/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}